---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Layout>
    <div class="relative h-screen w-screen overflow-hidden">
        <Nav classes={["z-40", "absolute"]}/>
        <div class="flex h-screen">
            <div class="m-auto px-6 z-12 text-center">
                <h2 class="text-gray-200 text-4xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold text-shadow-gray-500 text-shadow-sm mb-8 text-wrap">Lights. Camera. Loyalty.</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-200 text-xl lg:text-2xl text-shadow-gray-500 text-shadow-sm text-wrap">Connect with fans and ignite your brand though engaging video production from Fictive Flame Media.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute w-screen h-4/5 bottom-0 z-11 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-950/0 to-gray-950/100"
        >
        </div>
        <video
            autoplay
            loop
            muted
            playsinline
            class="absolute z-10 inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
        >
            <source
                src="https://storage.fictiveflame.co/background-hd-portfolio.mp4"
                type="video/mp4"
            />
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>
    </div>
    <Container>
        <div class="-mt-48 lg:-mt-32 z-20 flex flex-wrap relative font-neogrote text-gray-300 lg:text-gray-400 p-6 lg:p-0">
            <div class="w-full mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl lg:w-1/3 lg:mt-0 hover:scale-105 hover:bg-gray-900 transition-all hover:text-gray-200">
                <a href="/work">
                    <span class="flex items-center">
                        <h2 class="inline-block text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-6 font-bold">Featured Work</h2>
                        <svg class="inline-block h-8 -mt-4" width="100px" height="100px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <g>
                                <path id="Vector" d="M10.0002 5H8.2002C7.08009 5 6.51962 5 6.0918 5.21799C5.71547 5.40973 5.40973 5.71547 5.21799 6.0918C5 6.51962 5 7.08009 5 8.2002V15.8002C5 16.9203 5 17.4801 5.21799 17.9079C5.40973 18.2842 5.71547 18.5905 6.0918 18.7822C6.5192 19 7.07899 19 8.19691 19H15.8031C16.921 19 17.48 19 17.9074 18.7822C18.2837 18.5905 18.5905 18.2839 18.7822 17.9076C19 17.4802 19 16.921 19 15.8031V14M20 9V4M20 4H15M20 4L13 11" stroke="#999999" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            </g>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <p class="text-wrap">
                        In today's world, stories are currency. From the first words though to the finished product, we can help you make an impact.
                    </p>
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl lg:w-1/3 lg:mt-0 hover:scale-105 hover:bg-gray-900 transition-all hover:text-gray-200">
                <a href="/about">
                    <span class="flex items-center">
                        <h2 class="inline-block text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-6 font-bold">Capabilities</h2>
                        <svg class="inline-block h-8 -mt-4" width="100px" height="100px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <g>
                                <path id="Vector" d="M10.0002 5H8.2002C7.08009 5 6.51962 5 6.0918 5.21799C5.71547 5.40973 5.40973 5.71547 5.21799 6.0918C5 6.51962 5 7.08009 5 8.2002V15.8002C5 16.9203 5 17.4801 5.21799 17.9079C5.40973 18.2842 5.71547 18.5905 6.0918 18.7822C6.5192 19 7.07899 19 8.19691 19H15.8031C16.921 19 17.48 19 17.9074 18.7822C18.2837 18.5905 18.5905 18.2839 18.7822 17.9076C19 17.4802 19 16.921 19 15.8031V14M20 9V4M20 4H15M20 4L13 11" stroke="#999999" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            </g>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <p class="text-wrap">Some may say art and science don't mix, but for us there's no other way. We are broadcast engineers and filmmakers, all in service of your story.</p>
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl lg:w-1/3 lg:mt-0 hover:scale-105 hover:bg-gray-900 transition-all hover:text-gray-200">
                <a href="/contact">
                    <span class="flex items-center">
                        <h2 class="inline-block text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-6 font-bold">Get In Touch</h2>
                        <svg class="inline-block h-8 -mt-4" width="100px" height="100px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <g>
                                <path id="Vector" d="M10.0002 5H8.2002C7.08009 5 6.51962 5 6.0918 5.21799C5.71547 5.40973 5.40973 5.71547 5.21799 6.0918C5 6.51962 5 7.08009 5 8.2002V15.8002C5 16.9203 5 17.4801 5.21799 17.9079C5.40973 18.2842 5.71547 18.5905 6.0918 18.7822C6.5192 19 7.07899 19 8.19691 19H15.8031C16.921 19 17.48 19 17.9074 18.7822C18.2837 18.5905 18.5905 18.2839 18.7822 17.9076C19 17.4802 19 16.921 19 15.8031V14M20 9V4M20 4H15M20 4L13 11" stroke="#999999" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            </g>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <p class="text-wrap">
                        If you have an idea that's out of the ordinary, we want to hear it. Pitch your idea to a team who can see the future of storytelling.
                    </p>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Container>
    <Footer/>
</Layout>
